      "versionNonce": 117222322,
      "boundElements": [],
      "text": "Dashed box  =  a monorepo\n(one team's codebase).\n\nSolid box  =  a deployed\nservice / API.\n\nArrow  =  calls / depends on.\n\nEach API abstracts ≥ 2\ninterchangeable providers\n(plug-and-play).",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Dashed box  =  a monorepo\n(one team's codebase).\n\nSolid box  =  a deployed\nservice / API.\n\nArrow  =  calls / depends on.\n\nEach API abstracts ≥ 2\ninterchangeable providers\n(plug-and-play).",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
